:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 💡 Suggestion（普通建议）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">可以采纳也可以不采纳。通常涉及：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 代码风格偏好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 文档措辞优化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 可选的增强功能</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 📝 Nit（细节）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">极小的问题，不影响技术决策。通常涉及：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 拼写错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 格式不一致</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 引用链接失效</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用格式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"**[Blocker]** 这个方案没有考虑数据库连接池耗尽的场景。当并发请求超过 1000 时，所有连接会被占满导致服务不可用。建议添加连接池限流和排队机制。&#10;&#10;**[Suggestion]** 考虑使用 Circuit Breaker 模式来防止下游服务故障时的级联失败。参考 resilience4j 库。&#10;&#10;**[Nit]** 第三段中 &quot;PostgreSQL&quot; 拼写为 &quot;Postgresql&quot;。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">Blocker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">]**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 这个方案没有考虑数据库连接池耗尽的场景。当并发请求超过 1000 时，所有连接会被占满导致服务不可用。建议添加连接池限流和排队机制。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">Suggestion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">]**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 考虑使用 Circuit Breaker 模式来防止下游服务故障时的级联失败。参考 resilience4j 库。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">Nit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">]**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 第三段中 \"PostgreSQL\" 拼写为 \"Postgresql\"。</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"处理评审分歧\">处理评审分歧</h3><p>当评审人之间或评审人与作者之间存在分歧时：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;评审人提出异议&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;异议类型?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|事实性分歧| C[&quot;提供数据/证据&lt;br/&gt;POC/Benchmark&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|偏好性分歧| D[&quot;记录双方观点&lt;br/&gt;作者决定&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|原则性分歧| E[&quot;升级到&lt;br/&gt;Decision Maker&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;更新文档&lt;br/&gt;反映结果&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;30 分钟同步会议&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;Decision Maker 裁决&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[\"评审人提出异议\"] --&gt; B{\"异议类型?\"}\n    B --&gt;|事实性分歧| C[\"提供数据/证据&lt;br/&gt;POC/Benchmark\"]\n    B --&gt;|偏好性分歧| D[\"记录双方观点&lt;br/&gt;作者决定\"]\n    B --&gt;|原则性分歧| E[\"升级到&lt;br/&gt;Decision Maker\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"更新文档&lt;br/&gt;反映结果\"]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; G[\"30 分钟同步会议\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"Decision Maker 裁决\"]\n    H --&gt; F</pre><p><strong>处理分歧的原则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>假定善意——评审人的反对是基于技术判断而非个人偏好</li>\n<li>用数据说话——避免「我觉得」式的争论</li>\n<li>时间盒约束——分歧讨论不超过 48 小时，超时则升级</li>\n<li>记录决策理由——无论结果如何，记录为什么选择了特定方向</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"实际案例-stripe-的异步评审文化\">实际案例：Stripe 的异步评审文化</h3><p>Stripe 以其强大的写作文化著称。其评审机制的关键特点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## Stripe 评审实践要点&#10;&#10;1. **预读文化**：会议前所有参与者必须阅读文档。会议不用于&quot;介绍方案&quot;，而用于&quot;讨论分歧&quot;。&#10;&#10;2. **Silent Reading**：重大设计评审的前 15 分钟，所有人安静阅读文档并在 Google Docs 中留下评论。&#10;&#10;3. **Written Decisions**：即使进行了同步讨论，决策和理由必须书面记录在文档中。&#10;&#10;4. **DACI 模型**：&#10;   - Driver：驱动项目的工程师&#10;   - Approver：拥有最终决策权的人&#10;   - Contributors：提供输入的人&#10;   - Informed：需要了解结果的人&#10;&#10;5. **48 小时规则**：评审人有 48 小时的反馈窗口。超时未回复视为默认同意。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Stripe 评审实践要点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">1.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **预读文化**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">：会议前所有参与者必须阅读文档。会议不用于\"介绍方案\"，而用于\"讨论分歧\"。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">2.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **Silent Reading**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">：重大设计评审的前 15 分钟，所有人安静阅读文档并在 Google Docs 中留下评论。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">3.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **Written Decisions**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">：即使进行了同步讨论，决策和理由必须书面记录在文档中。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">4.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **DACI 模型**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">   -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Driver：驱动项目的工程师</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">   -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Approver：拥有最终决策权的人</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">   -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Contributors：提供输入的人</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">   -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Informed：需要了解结果的人</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">5.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **48 小时规则**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">：评审人有 48 小时的反馈窗口。超时未回复视为默认同意。</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"评审效率优化\">评审效率优化</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>做法</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前置摘要</td>\n<td>文档开头提供 3 句话 TL;DR</td>\n<td>评审人快速判断需投入的精力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>明确关注点</td>\n<td>列出 2-3 个需要评审人重点看的问题</td>\n<td>避免评审人浪费时间在非关键部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分段评审</td>\n<td>大文档分为「必读」和「可选」部分</td>\n<td>降低评审门槛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评审引导</td>\n<td>在文档中嵌入评审问题</td>\n<td>引导评审人的注意力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间窗口</td>\n<td>明确截止日期和后果</td>\n<td>避免无限拖延</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"远程团队的决策公告模板\">远程团队的决策公告模板</h3><p>决策达成后的公告需要简洁且完整：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## 📢 Architecture Decision: [标题]&#10;&#10;**TL;DR:** [一句话总结决策]&#10;&#10;**RFC/Design Doc:** [链接] **ADR:** [链接（如已创建）] **Decision Date:** [日期] **Decision Maker:** [姓名]&#10;&#10;### What We Decided&#10;&#10;[2-3 句话描述决策内容]&#10;&#10;### Key Tradeoffs&#10;&#10;- ✅ [获得的好处]&#10;- ⚠️ [接受的代价]&#10;&#10;### What This Means for You&#10;&#10;- [对团队 A 的影响和行动项]&#10;- [对团队 B 的影响和行动项]&#10;&#10;### Timeline&#10;&#10;- [里程碑 1]：[日期]&#10;- [里程碑 2]：[日期]&#10;&#10;### Questions?&#10;&#10;Contact: [负责人] 或在 #arch-decisions 频道讨论\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 📢 Architecture Decision: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">标题</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**TL;DR:**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">一句话总结决策</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**RFC/Design Doc:**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">链接</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**ADR:**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">链接（如已创建）</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**Decision Date:**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">日期</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**Decision Maker:**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">姓名</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### What We Decided</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[2-3 句话描述决策内容]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Key Tradeoffs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ✅ [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">获得的好处</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ⚠️ [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">接受的代价</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### What This Means for You</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [对团队 A 的影响和行动项]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [对团队 B 的影响和行动项]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Timeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [里程碑 1]：[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">日期</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [里程碑 2]：[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">日期</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Questions?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Contact: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">负责人</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] 或在 #arch-decisions 频道讨论</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"评审质量度量\">评审质量度量</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>健康范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>评审参与率</td>\n<td>实际评审人数 / 指定评审人数</td>\n<td>&gt; 80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均评审耗时</td>\n<td>从发布到所有人完成评审的天数</td>\n<td>3-5 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blocker 解决率</td>\n<td>按时解决的 Blocker 数 / 总 Blocker 数</td>\n<td>&gt; 95%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评审深度</td>\n<td>平均每份文档的实质性评论数</td>\n<td>5-15 条</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策翻转率</td>\n<td>实施后被推翻的决策 / 总决策数</td>\n<td>&lt; 10%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"异步评审工具链\">异步评审工具链</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>核心功能</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GitHub PR Reviews</td>\n<td>行级评论、审批流</td>\n<td>代码仓库中的 RFC/Design Doc</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google Docs Comments</td>\n<td>实时协作、建议模式</td>\n<td>跨职能团队的设计讨论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Notion Comments</td>\n<td>块级评论、@mention</td>\n<td>轻量级团队内部评审</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linear/Jira + Docs</td>\n<td>工作项与文档关联</td>\n<td>需要跟踪评审进度的组织</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Loom + Async Video</td>\n<td>视频解释复杂决策</td>\n<td>需要演示的方案讨论</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"自动化评审提醒\">自动化评审提醒</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Action: RFC 评审提醒&#10;name: RFC Review Reminder&#10;on:&#10;  schedule:&#10;    - cron: &#39;0 9 * * 1-5&#39; # 工作日早上 9 点&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  remind:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - name: Check pending reviews&#10;        uses: actions/github-script@v7&#10;        with:&#10;          script: |&#10;            const prs = await github.rest.pulls.list({&#10;              owner: context.repo.owner,&#10;              repo: context.repo.repo,&#10;              state: &#39;open&#39;,&#10;              labels: &#39;rfc&#39;&#10;            });&#10;&#10;            for (const pr of prs.data) {&#10;              const created = new Date(pr.created_at);&#10;              const now = new Date();&#10;              const daysOpen = (now - created) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24);&#10;              &#10;              if (daysOpen &gt; 3 &amp;&amp; daysOpen &lt; 7) {&#10;                // 发送 Slack 提醒&#10;                await fetch(process.env.SLACK_WEBHOOK, {&#10;                  method: &#39;POST&#39;,&#10;                  body: JSON.stringify({&#10;                    text: `⏰ RFC review pending: &quot;${pr.title}&quot; (${Math.floor(daysOpen)} days). Please review before deadline.`&#10;                  })&#10;                });&#10;              }&#10;            }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Action: RFC 评审提醒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RFC Review Reminder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  schedule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cron</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0 9 * * 1-5'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 工作日早上 9 点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  remind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Check pending reviews</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/github-script@v7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            const prs = await github.rest.pulls.list({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              owner: context.repo.owner,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              repo: context.repo.repo,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              state: 'open',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              labels: 'rfc'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            for (const pr of prs.data) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              const created = new Date(pr.created_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              const now = new Date();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              const daysOpen = (now - created) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              if (daysOpen > 3 &#x26;&#x26; daysOpen &#x3C; 7) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                // 发送 Slack 提醒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                await fetch(process.env.SLACK_WEBHOOK, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                  method: 'POST',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                  body: JSON.stringify({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                    text: `⏰ RFC review pending: \"${pr.title}\" (${Math.floor(daysOpen)} days). Please review before deadline.`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                  })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>异步评审的成功关键不在于工具的选择，而在于文化的建立。核心原则包括：明确的时间窗口（不允许无限拖延）、结构化的反馈格式（评论分级）、清晰的决策规则（何时用共识何时用裁决），以及对书面表达的重视（讨论和决策都必须书面记录）。从「异步优先 + 同步兜底」开始实践，逐步培养团队的写作文化和异步协作能力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"异步评审与决策机制","id":"异步评审与决策机制"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"异步优先的评审哲学","id":"异步优先的评审哲学"},{"level":3,"text":"评审角色定义","id":"评审角色定义"},{"level":3,"text":"决策模型","id":"决策模型"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"设计异步评审流程","id":"设计异步评审流程"},{"level":3,"text":"评论分级系统","id":"评论分级系统"},{"level":3,"text":"处理评审分歧","id":"处理评审分歧"},{"level":3,"text":"实际案例：Stripe 的异步评审文化","id":"实际案例-stripe-的异步评审文化"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"评审效率优化","id":"评审效率优化"},{"level":3,"text":"远程团队的决策公告模板","id":"远程团队的决策公告模板"},{"level":3,"text":"评审质量度量","id":"评审质量度量"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"异步评审工具链","id":"异步评审工具链"},{"level":3,"text":"自动化评审提醒","id":"自动化评审提醒"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"设计文档模板与写作方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/rfc-and-design-docs/design-doc-templates"},"next":{"title":"技术雷达与技术选型治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/architecture-decision-records/decision-governance/tech-radar-governance"}}